title: BVP Integration
new-page: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_affairs_timer <= 0 and bvp_integration < 4
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_affairs_timer = 4;

= BVP Integration

Current Integration Level: [+ bvp_integration +] ([? if bvp_integration == 0: <span style="color:#808080;">Separate</span> ?][? if bvp_integration == 1: <span style="color:#A0A050;">Aligned</span> ?][? if bvp_integration == 2: <span style="color:#C0C060;">Associated</span> ?][? if bvp_integration == 3: <span style="color:#E0E070;">Enmeshed</span> ?][? if bvp_integration == 4: <span style="color:#FFFF80;">Unified</span> ?])
Current Relations: [+ bvp_relations +]/100
[? if z_in_government != 1 and out_of_government_malus > 0: <span style="color:#8B0000;">Out-of-Government Malus: [+ out_of_government_malus +] (impairs integration efforts)</span> ?]

Integration Effects:
[? if bvp_integration >= 1: <span style="color:#008000;">✓</span> BVP more willing to join coalitions ?]
[? if bvp_integration >= 2: <span style="color:#008000;">✓</span> Heinrich Held available as advisor ?]
[? if bvp_integration >= 3: <span style="color:#008000;">✓</span> Fritz Schäffer available as advisor ?]
[? if bvp_integration >= 4: <span style="color:#008000;">✓</span> Gustav Ritter von Kahr available as advisor; Total Bavarian control; BVP guaranteed to join any government ?]
[? if bvp_integration >= 1: <span style="color:#008000;">✓</span> Anti-Fascist leaders Moenius & Hundhammer unlockable ?]

Stickiness: Separate→Aligned and Enmeshed→Unified require more investment.

- @invest_integration: Invest in Integration ([+ integration_cost +] resources)
- @z_party_hub: Return to Party Affairs
- @easy_discard

@invest_integration
title: Deepen BVP Integration
subtitle: Spend political capital to bind the BVP closer to the Zentrum.
choose-if: resources >= integration_cost
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources < integration_cost: Need [+ integration_cost +] resources. ?][? if bvp_relations < relation_threshold: BVP Relations too low ([+ bvp_relations +]/100, need [+ relation_threshold +]). ?][? if z_in_government != 1 and out_of_government_malus > 10: <span style="color:#8B0000;">High malus impairs BVP integration</span> ?]
on-arrival: {!
// Calculate integration cost based on current level (stickiness: Separate→Aligned and Enmeshed→Unified cost more)
if (Q.bvp_integration == 0) Q.integration_cost = 3;      // Separate → Aligned
else if (Q.bvp_integration == 1) Q.integration_cost = 2;  // Aligned → Associated
else if (Q.bvp_integration == 2) Q.integration_cost = 2;  // Associated → Enmeshed
else if (Q.bvp_integration == 3) Q.integration_cost = 3;  // Enmeshed → Unified

// Relation threshold increases with integration level
if (Q.bvp_integration == 0) Q.relation_threshold = 30;   // Separate → Aligned
else if (Q.bvp_integration == 1) Q.relation_threshold = 40; // Aligned → Associated
else if (Q.bvp_integration == 2) Q.relation_threshold = 50; // Associated → Enmeshed
else if (Q.bvp_integration == 3) Q.relation_threshold = 60; // Enmeshed → Unified

// Malus penalty: increases cost and threshold
var malus_penalty = 0;
if (Q.z_in_government != 1 && Q.out_of_government_malus > 0) {
    malus_penalty = Math.floor(Q.out_of_government_malus / 10);
    Q.integration_cost += malus_penalty;
    Q.relation_threshold += malus_penalty * 5;
}

Q.resources -= Q.integration_cost;
Q.bvp_integration += 1;
if (Q.bvp_integration > 4) Q.bvp_integration = 4;
!}
go-to: z_bvp_integration_result

@z_bvp_integration_result
title: Integration Progress
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var messages = [
    "The BVP agrees to coordinate more closely on Reichstag votes. Integration advances to Aligned.",
    "Joint policy working groups are established. The BVP becomes Associated with the Zentrum.",
    "Deep institutional links form. The BVP is now Enmeshed with the Zentrum.",
    "The BVP and Zentrum operate as a single political force in Bavaria. Unified integration achieved."
];
Q.z_bvp_int_text = messages[Q.bvp_integration - 1] || "Integration updated.";
!}

{! Q.z_bvp_int_text !}

New Integration Level: [+ bvp_integration +] ([? if bvp_integration == 0: Separate ?][? if bvp_integration == 1: Aligned ?][? if bvp_integration == 2: Associated ?][? if bvp_integration == 3: Enmeshed ?][? if bvp_integration == 4: Unified ?])

- @z_bvp_integration: Continue Integration Efforts
- @z_party_hub: Return to Party Affairs